====Verb====
{{nl-verb}}

# {{lb|nl|transitive|reflexive}} to [[shave]] (reflexive pronouns are used for self-directed actions)
#: {{ux|nl|hij scheert zich nu|he's shaving now|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|nl|de arts scheerde de huid rond de wond van de patiënt|the doctor shaved the skin around the patient's wound|inline=1}}
# {{lb|nl|transitive}} to [[shear]]
#: {{ux|nl|morgen gaan ze de schapen scheren|they will shear the sheep tomorrow|inline=1}}

